---

The **Event Wand** does both jobs. `Alt + Mouse Wheel` flips Trigger / Location.

- `Shift + Right Click` — store the current event id on the wand
- `Alt + Mouse Wheel` — Trigger or Location
- `Right Click` — stamp that id on a marker, or inject it onto a normal block
- `Left Click` in creative on an injected marker — peel it off

Trigger blocks are cyan. Location blocks are orange. In Survival they are invisible and you cannot even target them. Jade will not light them up. Creative still gets the colored wireframes so you can edit.

Build in creative. Play in survival. If you can see the markers while playing the pack, you left creative mode on.
